# Daemons FSDK ships that a server node does not use. FSDK has no catch-all
# "disable *", so without these lines systemd enables them on first boot:
# - isnsd: open-isns's iSNS *server*, which listens on TCP 3205 on every
#   interface. The iSCSI initiator (80-bluefin-iscsi.preset) does not need
#   it; a node that should run an iSNS server enables it per node.
# - systemd-homed: portable home directories; this image has no homed users
#   (root ships locked, accounts come from sysusers and Ignition).
# bluefin-disable-unused-migrate.service applies these lines once on nodes
# that first booted an image without them.
disable isnsd.service
disable isnsd.socket
disable systemd-homed.service
disable systemd-homed-activate.service
